# The result format

Every role agent's **final message is this JSON and nothing else**. Write the full object to
`runs/<run>/<lane>/verdict.json`, and return only what is new or changed in this run.

```jsonc
{
  "flow": "business-signup",           // a slug from docs/qa/flow-backlog.md
  "role": "{{roles.0.slug}}",
  "lane": "A",
  "depth": "full",                     // smoke | full | verify
  "environment": { "name": "{{main_env}}", "surface": "web", "portal": "{{roles.0.portal_url}}", "build": null },
  "result": "pass",                    // pass | fail | blocked | partial
  "summary": "One sentence: what was covered and what the result rests on.",

  "screens": [
    {
      "name": "Choose a plan",
      "route": "/plans",
      "result": "pass",                // pass | fail | blocked
      "checks": { "design": "pass", "states": "pass", "functions": "pass", "server_agrees": "pass", "widths": [{{widths_text}}] },
      "proof": ["runs/…/A/03-plans.png"]
    }
  ],
  "carried_forward": [ { "name": "Sign in", "result": "pass", "from_run": "2026-10-20" } ],

  "defects": [
    {
      "title": "Plan updated email button opens the sign-in page",
      "severity": "P2",
      "screen": "Email: Plan updated",
      "steps": ["Sign in as an approved Business", "Open Plans, choose Gold, pay", "Open the email", "Click View plan"],
      "expected": "Plans page (spec §4.2)",
      "actual": "Sign-in page, even when signed in",
      "seen": "2 of 2",
      "from_screen_only": true,
      "proof": ["runs/…/A/07-email.png"]
    }
  ],
  "emails": [ { "action": "Pay for Gold", "subject": "Plan updated", "to": "…", "result": "fail" } ],
  "blocked": [ { "what": "Verification link for sara.c1", "reason": "mailbox", "needs": "lead" } ],
  "admin_request": null,               // e.g. { "action": "approve", "user_id": 123 }
  "fixtures_created": [ { "key": "FIX_{{roles.0.key}}_A_U1", "state": "Approved", "notes": "" } ],
  "coverage": { "screens_total": 8, "screens_done": 8, "not_covered": [ { "case": "Suspended user", "reason": "no fixture yet" } ] }
}
```

Rules:
- `defects[]` are **candidates**. They become issues only after the re-check (`qa-rechecker`).
- Anything marked `instrumented` can support a pass, never a defect.
- Don't re-send unchanged screens. List them in `carried_forward`.
